      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5084466338157654
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "He says that he has been in custody for 6 years and 10 months.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 707,
      "end": 769,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.08230382949113846
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "He prays for suspension of sentence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 770,
      "end": 806,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11496701836585999
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "2. We have seen the evidence of the victim girl (PW-2) and the examining doctor (PW-9).",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 807,
      "end": 895,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.07484368979930878
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "The victim, about 15 years old at the time of the incident, vividly narrates the heinous incident of how she was intercepted on the road, dragged to a corner and violated.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 896,
      "end": 1067,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13352641463279724
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "The medical examination report,\nprima facie, supports the prosecution.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1068,
      "end": 1138,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09643936902284622
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "3. In view of such incriminating evidence against the petitioner, we are not inclined to allow this application.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1140,
      "end": 1252,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.034741222858428955
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "4. CRAN 2 of 2026 is dismissed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1253,
      "end": 1285,
